# Secrets — never commit real credentials
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
Blueprints/apikey.json
data*orchestrate.json

# Local MCP server config (obsidian-local-rest-api's API key) — machine-
# specific (points at 127.0.0.1) and carries a live secret, not shareable.
.mcp.json

# The Obsidian vault — removed from version control 2026-08-07 (commits
# adf3cc1/e52ad08). It is a personal working notebook, not project source:
# screenshots, scratch notes, live credentials, megabytes of vendored
# third-party plugin bundles, and the generated Platform_Graph/ projection
# output the app writes at runtime. It still lives on disk and the
# projection layer still writes to it (orchestrate/obsidian/writer.py) —
# it just isn't tracked. The engineering roadmap that used to live here is
# in docs/PRODUCTIZATION.md instead.
ADOS_OBSIDIAN/

